   [#D7D7AF][/dim]grey, and every Bob surface honors it, so the gtd area renders grey[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]like the PLAN type in the Day and period stats strips.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]gtd_root_and_area_colors.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/gtd_root_and_area_colors.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ij[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ij/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli nearest-note colors, grey mute, and Review time on gtd[bold black on #FFD75F][/bold #D7AFFF] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: in bob-cli, resolve each home's hue from the nearest area or [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project `color:` slot (palette hue or grey), report `hue_source`, give [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]root groups the root's own hue, mute types named after a grey top-level [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]area, point the built-in review_time at gtd, extend the shared vectors, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and update docs and memory.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-plugins mirrors and grey root lanes[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plugins[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugins: in bob-plugins, mirror nearest-note colors and the grey mute in[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the home-chip and type-hue mirrors, keep muted roots gray in every root [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]lane, copy the shared vectors byte for byte, then test, build, and run [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`bob plugins sync`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Vault adoption and live verification[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli, plugins[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault: install bob from master, re-root the daily template's ^gtd row at[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]gtd, set gtd.md to `color: grey`, rewrite the daily notes the history [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]decision picks, and verify the live stats JSON and strips.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-ij","llm_provider":"claude","model":"opus","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-ij.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-5784ee02a9ee9e37dd4d0d949995101e","started_at":"2026-11-07T22:31:02.973976+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"e90de852d35bc8a90ca07b2002a541c86fc50fc1772d2a529cbd40388c21bdd9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ij.3/chat.md","size_bytes":6636},"commits":{"digest":"92c1bee798e3a4171cad5ebe1e090c1bff6863a1f278cb628d7451e5750d4cd1","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ij.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ij.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"7bc79f6c2da1f4cf70086de667cbc4abca4a6760293f6b10c21edfab65d73184","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ij.3/meta.json","size_bytes":698},"prompt":{"digest":"1971a4bd8851bcca78f02532060ba157ab417bb650c43404398a0cf8ec520ab8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ij.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":210},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"6ab00453ca69de80c5b9dbe1f54734389d5f4eb5c497cdd825a20cbbeb1e5c3c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-ij.3/promp